{"name": "Castle Crumble", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/62e076cb43fec81158d6d6480b2aa7c4.avif?t=1750402081\" width=\"616\"/></span>Embark on an adventure and conquer mighty kingdoms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Castle Crumble, your goal is clear\u2014castles must fall. Fulfill the dream of reducing towering fortresses to dust in a fully simulated physics environment. Could destruction be relaxing? In Castle Crumble it can!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/1206905538a6f28c419103c0f31f67f3.avif?t=1750402081\" width=\"616\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/d84e5ad6910bcebac7113057db80e39e.poster.avif?t=1750402081\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/d84e5ad6910bcebac7113057db80e39e.webm?t=1750402081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/d84e5ad6910bcebac7113057db80e39e.mp4?t=1750402081\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize a variety of tools to bring down castles in different ways. For even greater firepower, equip boosters and unleash true destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/62e076cb43fec81158d6d6480b2aa7c4.avif?t=1750402081\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/a12a64d19d01e41089964a76e80fb67f.poster.avif?t=1750402081\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/a12a64d19d01e41089964a76e80fb67f.webm?t=1750402081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/a12a64d19d01e41089964a76e80fb67f.mp4?t=1750402081\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every move counts. Use your limited ammo wisely, set up chain reactions, and watch as multi-staged castles crumble before your eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/05a312b032d9f1b0d71622c2545b2c55.avif?t=1750402081\" width=\"616\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/1e11be2c5c878e0d50cd4a371a6af4e8.poster.avif?t=1750402081\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/1e11be2c5c878e0d50cd4a371a6af4e8.webm?t=1750402081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/1e11be2c5c878e0d50cd4a371a6af4e8.mp4?t=1750402081\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each brick and wooden beam is individually simulated, allowing for dynamic and unpredictable destruction. Knock towers onto other buildings or trigger placed explosives with flying rubble for spectacular results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/41840b543e786ef7f7a6e2f89aa18adf.avif?t=1750402081\" width=\"616\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/10cc0d157295d2ffe1af04a3e6913e1f.poster.avif?t=1750402081\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/10cc0d157295d2ffe1af04a3e6913e1f.webm?t=1750402081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/10cc0d157295d2ffe1af04a3e6913e1f.mp4?t=1750402081\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the world of Castle Crumble, featuring unique and beautiful landscapes. From dense jungles to scorching deserts and serene coastal islands, each kingdom offers new challenges to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare to strategize, demolish, and conquer in Castle Crumble\u2014where every collapse is a victory!</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Mysterious castles appeared all over the world. Use powerful weapons to destroy them in creative ways. Shoot projectiles, plant explosives and wreck havock in the world where every brick is physically simulated.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/c1ab635ce609ab40b5668adbe774ba7611dc465c/header.jpg?t=1750402081", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Casual", "Strategy", "Action", "Puzzle", "3D", "Cartoony"], "developers": "Orbital Knight", "publishers": "Orbital Knight", "release_date": "Jun 19, 2025", "price": "$6.99", "appid": "3562340", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "5 May 2025 - Demo\n\nhttps://store.steampowered.com/app/3707990/Castle_Crumble_Demo/?curator_clanid=44917508", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/UP291equ57c", "first_seen": 1746396000.0, "review_rank": 1695}